From: Chen Minqiang <ptpt52@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: add optional natflow hardware control plane

Layer natflow over the native Ethernet, PPE, PON and wireless support.
Add the netdev/path ABI, paired flow lifecycle, QDMA injection and ACNT0
accounting. Serialize atomic installation and paired removal with PON
bearer replacement.

Use the base driver SRAM-only PPE policy for AN7563/AN7581/AN7583.
Connect mt76 wireless owner registration, learning, keepalive consumption
and lifecycle invalidation through a capability macro. Kernels without
this patch retain the base SRAM-only policy and native TC interfaces.

Signed-off-by: Chen Minqiang <ptpt52@gmail.com>
